# Architecture

## Layout

```
src/app/       → shell, navigation registry, providers (thin App.tsx)
src/core/      → components, storage, pdf, backup, ids, utils
src/domain/    → pure types + business rules (no React)
src/features/  → self-contained modules (dashboard, students, billing, …)
src/locales/   → es/ (default), en/
```

## Feature module contract

Each feature exports a `FeatureModule` via `index.ts`: `id`, `navItem`, `routes`, optional `onInit`.

```ts
// GOOD: Feature reads data through repository
const students = await studentRepository.list();

// BAD: Feature imports another feature
import { StudentsPage } from '../students/StudentsPage';
```

Cross-feature needs → `domain/` services or shared repositories in `core/storage/`.

## Stack

React 19 · TypeScript · Tailwind 4 · Tauri 2 · Zustand (per feature) · i18next · Vitest

## Adding a feature (checklist)

1. Types in `domain/`
2. Repository in `core/storage/` if persisted
3. Folder in `features/<name>/`
4. Register in `app/navigation/registry.ts`
5. i18n keys in both locales
